@startuml
'==== basic style ====
hide stereotype
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black
hidefootbox

autonumber

title "As a User, in the Web UI, I want to be able to sort the list \nof publications in my library by title, author, type or ISBN/SSN - SSD"

' --- Actor and participants ---

actor User
participant ":Mitelovers" as mite

User -> mite : show me what I can do
activate mite
mite --> User : here is what you can do
deactivate mite

User -> mite : I want to access "My Library"
activate mite
mite --> User : Items of your library
deactivate mite

User -> mite : I want to sort the list of items in library by \nby title/ author/ type/ ISBN/ISSN
activate mite
mite --> User : Sorted items of your library
deactivate mite

@enduml